      "content": "i know people say it gets better or that i should cherish the memories but honestly it just feels like a cruel joke. like why do we even bother doing anything if the only thing that actually made me feel safe and happy is just... gone? it feels like i'm just waiting for the next thing to be taken away. it's exhausting to keep trying when everything is just going to end up empty anyway.",
